# Summary

The handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook [[cite:obs-129b37a4cf64c3d82b73c3e36e0a6e4d28340257 "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

The appendix specifies that bays twelve through thirty are blocked and reserved for supplier vans only, with a midday deadline [[cite:obs-6606c568516c4e14852c1a2576120fe01cf4ee8f "Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline."]].

This implies a time limit for parking in these reserved spaces until midday.  